Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.50,0:00:09.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Dream Realm is an AI-native playable creator world where people enter missions,\Nmake creative choices, and publish results back into the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.00,0:00:23.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Dream Realm, Naya, the Hub, and this playable creator foundation existed before the challenge.\NThe challenge work is the WebMCP extension layered onto that existing experience.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.50,0:00:35.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,The deployed page registers eight structured WebMCP tools. The agent reads the same live state\Nas the player, validates every transition, and never fakes interface clicks.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.00,0:00:48.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here the agent starts the Dance Gateway mission and restores Signal Sync. Noiz corrupts the pattern;\Nstructured signal actions repair it while the visible score and mission react immediately.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.00,0:00:59.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Murk introduces doubt. The agent chooses the evidence earned in gameplay,\Nadvancing the same shared state into Creator Tools.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.00,0:01:13.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now the agent sets Naya's outfit, background, movement, and outcome effect.\NThese choices prepare the exact 145-frame performance visible on screen.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.00,0:01:30.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Naya performs the selected Glamour look, Street scene, and Power Finish. The human keeps the\Nmeaningful consent boundary: video recording and download remain an explicit human action.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.00,0:01:46.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Only after the real WebM export is ready can the agent send the output to Trending Tower.\NInvalid or premature actions are rejected by the live controller.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.00,0:02:04.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Tower ranks the restored Dance signal, grants the unlock, and the agent returns to the Hub.\NThe activated Tower persists: one world, one live state, shared by human and agent.
